# Debt Optimizer App 🧮💸

A web-based tool to help users build a custom debt payoff plan based on:
- Debt list with balances, interest, due dates
- Monthly household expenses
- Payroll income timing

## 🧰 Stack

- **Frontend**: React + Tailwind CSS + ShadCN UI + Recharts
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express

## 📦 Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/debt-optimizer-app.git
cd debt-optimizer-app
